{
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.0,
      "text": " In the last few months, I shipped four real products, not mockups, and we build things the smarter way."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.34,
      "end": 11.98,
      "text": " First, ClipFlow. It scans long videos, finds the viral moments, adds animated captions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.46,
      "end": 15.78,
      "text": " and posts straight to Instagram and YouTube, then Wireframer."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.48,
      "end": 21.92,
      "text": " Give it one prompt or one reference image, and it designs a full screen for phone, tablet or desktop,"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.46,
      "end": 26.34,
      "text": " clean HTML, CSS and JavaScript, FoodSnap."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.34,
      "end": 30.34,
      "text": " Point your camera at any meal, and AI gives you the calories instantly."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.88,
      "end": 35.48,
      "text": " Diary, progress tracking and subscriptions are built in, and the AR menu viewer."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.26,
      "end": 40.9,
      "text": " Customers point their phone at the table, and the dish appears in 3D, right in front of them."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.46,
      "end": 46.04,
      "text": " Flutter, Next.js, Node, and AI. I build fast, and I ship."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.54,
      "end": 48.46,
      "text": " Need a product built? Message me."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.78,
      "end": 53.2,
      "text": " And if you want to know how I made these motion graphics, comment full guide. Follow Thynk."
    }
  ],
